<title>THAILAND: Bkk Bank of Commerce posts big 1996 loss.</title>
<headline>Bkk Bank of Commerce posts big 1996 loss.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>			  (million baht unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)  loss	 12.79	vs   profit    1.34</p>
<p>    Net	   loss   24,853.85	vs   profit  860.39</p>
<p>NOTE: Results are audited and sourced to Stock Exchange of Thailand. The 1996 results are revised from a previously announced unaudited 1996 loss of 1.46 baht per share and net loss of 2.84 billion baht. Those figures were announced on January 22. Bangkok Bank of Commerce Plc is a commercial bank.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
